	key[]: "missing"
	val[]: "saknas" #+ Specified input (axis or button) is missing. For example joystick is unplugged.

	key[]: "unknown"
	val[]: "okänd" #+ Name of specified input (axis or button) could not be determined.

	key[]: "complex"
	val[]: "komplex" #+ The configuration of input is too complex so the name of the input could not be determined. This can happen if the player manually tweaks the input configuration.

	key[]: "hold"
	val[]: "Håll" #+ Used as prefix to keys / icons to signalize that you have to hold the button for the action. If possible keep this as short one word to prevent it being shortened, it appears as part of in-game hint with limited width.

